e shoes of a chimp and explore the lush rainforest, swinging from vines and leaping between trees.And you'll need to use your natural chimp abilities to navigate your environment.\n\nAs you play the game more, you'll unlock new abilities and discover hidden treasures, all while immersing yourself in the stunning 3D world around you., Chimp World is the perfect VR game for anyone who loves adventure, exploration, and nature.\n\nSo what are you waiting for? Grab your VR headset and get ready to enter the wild and wonderful world of Chimp World! the original game is called gorilla tag you should also download it", "short_description": "oo oo ah ah"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimpworldwebsite/privacy_details", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gorillatagfangamedevs", "support_website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimpworldwebsite/support", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimpworldwebsite", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "7336818136354504"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411992_391446343559166_5099640866025582651_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AOUMrjkCFyEQ7kNvwH72q5Q&_nc_oc=Adkvrx_MJrZwI50RX1SDG7h9NI